tic.co/products/elasticsearch","size":1565901,"stargazers_count":76300,"watchers_count":76300,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":25807,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5588,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["elasticsearch","java","search-engine"],"visibility":"public","forks":25807,"open_issues":5588,"watchers":76300,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/pulls/24115","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/24115","diff_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/24115.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/24115.patch","merged_at":"2017-04-26T09:27:44Z"},"body":"The percolator doesn't close the IndexReader of the memory index any more.\r\nPrior to 2.x the percolator had its own SearchContext (PercolatorContext) that did this,\r\nbut that was removed when the percolator was refactored as part of the 5.0 release.\r\n\r\nI think an alternative way to fix this is to let percolator not use the bitset and fielddata caches,\r\nthat way we prevent the memory leak.\r\n\r\nAdding a WIP label to this as I'm not happy with the current test. It is not easy to test that we don't use the bitset or fielddata cache for the percolator, because non percolator operations may use these caches, which is valid.\r\n\r\nPR for #24108","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/24115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timel